{"version":1,"content":"<p>早上8時50分，天文台錄得氣溫25.9°C，相對濕度62%。</p><p>乾燥的東北季候風正影響廣東，該區天色大致良好。</p><p>本港今日（25日）天氣預測天晴乾燥，日間最高氣溫約31°C。</p><p>吹和緩北至東北風。</p><p>展望明日（26日）大致天晴，隨後一兩日風勢較大，雲量逐漸增多。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-25T01:40:39.419008+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":127,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T00:55:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T04:13:25.537462+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-25T01:38:15.460548+00:00","content_hash":"52012687d47e2dfb0ddc68e9f3d5382aa40c3ce0e05109bf39080b44269ad035","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}